<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Genre (Optional):</strong> Drama/emotional</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> An anomalous friendship bracelet kit (possibly from Dr. Wondertainment) that anomalously links those who wear created friendship bracelets. Effects vary depending on what materials are used in the bracelets, letter beads could allow telepathic communication between the wearers etc.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> The central narrative is told through several diary entries and notes left between the two previous owners. The story is about two close friends who drift apart, despite being anomalously linked. Diary entries will be from the perspective of Angela, who is doing everything she can to not lose Bri (her best friend) who moved away. Bri slowly pulls away and starts going down a different path than her friend. Angela knows this, but still fights to keep her best friend. This proved unsuccessful in the end however, as Bri suddenly cut ties with Angela, evidently removing the bracelet and all other methods of communication. About a month after this, Angela receives a letter along with Bri's bracelet and half of the kit.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> This is primarily a story about two friends who drifted apart despite everything available to keep them together. I believe this is a story that many people can empathize with through personal experience, and thus will probably elicit an emotional response.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> I intend on drawing on my own personal experience when creating this story, and hope that this will allow others to empathize with my characters. I will determine the extraneous effects of the bracelets materials as I write the story, as the SCP is more of a vessel to tell it.</p>

